    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d83-f1" n="1" xml:id="d83-f1-content">
                <p>Excludes $1 billion borrowing authority over the period 1972, 1974.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d83-f2" n="2" xml:id="d83-f2-content">
                <p>Excludes Indus loans authorized in the Foreign Assistance Act of 1967.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d83-f3" n="3" xml:id="d83-f3-content">
                <p>Excludes Administrative expenses, State, which has permanent authorization of
                    necessary amounts.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d83-f4" n="4" xml:id="d83-f4-content">
                <p>In addition, the Act authorizes appropriation of amounts as may be necessary for
                    reserves of the Overseas Private Investment Corporation.</p>
            </note>
